<section>
<h2>Our Story</h2>
<p>
Sweet Crumbs Bakery started with a simple goal: bring handcrafted baked
goods and a sense of community to our neighborhood. What began as a
family dream has grown into a local gathering place for fresh bread,
pastries, and celebrations.
</p>
</section>
 
<section>
<h2>Our Sourcing Philosophy</h2>
<p>
We believe great baking starts with great ingredients. Whenever
possible, we source fresh dairy, eggs, fruits, and grains from trusted
local suppliers to ensure quality and flavor.
</p>
</section>
 
